    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so loud lately. not even like literal noise, just everything. the lights, the people, the thoughts in my head... it never stops. i feel like i'm constantly vibrating and i just cant find a way to make it all go quiet. i just want it to be still. i just want some actual peace.",
